OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested after 'explosive
OL,4,Asubstances' found
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 70-year-old man is in custody after
OL,7,Fpolice found guns, drugs and "suspected
OL,8,Fexplosives" while carrying out an
OL,9,Farrest for alleged fraud.
OL,11,FThe Explosive Ordnance Disposal Unit
OL,12,F(EOD) was called to the home on Becket
OL,13,FRoad in Worle, Weston-super-Mare in
OL,14,FNorth Somerset, at about 14:15 BST on
OL,15,FWednesday.
OL,17,FAvon and Somerset Police set up a
OL,18,F100-metre (328ft) cordon in the area
OL,19,Fand 153 nearby homes were evacuated
OL,20,Fwhilst the EOD seized and destroyed the
OL,21,Fitems.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
